This page contains a mock dashboard with some mock data - which looks the same for users and organizations.

- **Location:** `apps/web/app/[locale]/(internal)/dashboard/page.tsx`
- **Route:** `/dashboard`

This page gives you a starting point from which you can build the home page of your application. This is part of the [Next.js Drizzle SaaS Kit](/drizzle).

